{"_id":"64346f5d8d68561d7050d6c4","id":"mayerantoine/injury-narrative-coding","author":"mayerantoine","sha":"61ac88cc557f00ba44aa78190116b185bb4b8ac7","lastModified":"2023-04-18T15:17:09.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["task_categories:text-classification","language:en","license:apache-2.0","size_categories:100K<n<1M","region:us","medical"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Card for Dataset Name\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nDataset used in 2018 NASA-Tournament-Lab organized in collaboration with National Institute for Occupational Safety and Health (NIOSH),\nThe goal of the competition was to classify unstructured free-text “injury narratives” \nrecorded in surveillance systems into injury codes from the Occupational Injuries and Illnesses Classification System (OIICS)\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSupported Tasks and Leaderboards\n\t\n\nThis is a multi-class… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/mayerantoine/injury-narrative-coding.","downloads":72,"likes":0,"cardData":{"license":"apache-2.0","task_categories":["text-classification"],"language":["en"],"tags":["medical"],"size_categories":["100K<n<1M"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"full_dataset.csv"},{"rfilename":"test.csv"},{"rfilename":"train.csv"}],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T20:19:41.000Z","usedStorage":38549336}